# Homicide Investigator: only nontoken creatures *you control* dying trigger it (CR 603.2, 111.7). Bot2 casts Hunted Bonebrute, so Bot1 creates two Dog tokens. Bot2 Bolts a
# Dog: a token dying is not a nontoken creature, no Clue. Bot2 then Bolts its own Memnite: not Bot1's creature, no Clue (and neither death uses up the once-each-turn limit).
# On turn 4 a Bolt on Bot1's Memnite makes the Clue, the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Homicide Investigator
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Hunted Bonebrute
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
